{
  "info": {
    "name": "AI Orchestration Platform",
    "description": "AI-powered orchestration platform that uses Google Gemini to interpret natural language requests, generate execution plans, and delegate work to downstream microservices (flight search, weather forecast).\n\n## Architecture\n\n- **Gateway** (port 8080) — AI planning + execution engine. Accepts natural language via POST /api/v1/chat, delegates to flight-service and weather-service.\n- **Flight Service** (port 8081) — Flight search via GET /api/v1/flights/search.\n- **Weather Service** (port 8082) — Weather forecast via GET /api/v1/weather/forecast.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Ensure all three services are running.\n2. Set `GEMINI_API_KEY` environment variable (required by the gateway).\n3. Send requests — the pre-request script auto-generates `traceId` and `conversationId`.\n4. Repeat requests with the same `X-Conversation-Id` header value to test multi-turn conversation memory.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "version": "v1"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Gateway",
      "description": "AI orchestration endpoint. Sends a natural language message to the planner, which generates and executes an execution plan across downstream services.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Chat — Full (Flight + Weather)",
          "request": {
            "description": "Complex scenario requesting both flight search and weather forecast. The AI planner generates a two-step parallel execution plan.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Trace-Id",
                "value": "{{traceId}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Conversation-Id",
                "value": "{{conversationId}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"Find flights from Bangalore to Tokyo next Friday and check the weather in Tokyo.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "chat"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success — Flight + Weather",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                },
                {
                  "key": "X-Trace-Id",
                  "value": "{{traceId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "X-Conversation-Id",
                  "value": "{{conversationId}}"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"partialSuccess\": false,\n  \"completedSteps\": [\"step-1\", \"step-2\"],\n  \"failedSteps\": [],\n  \"executionTrace\": [\n    {\n      \"stepId\": \"step-1\",\n      \"tool\": \"flight.search\",\n      \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"flights\": [\n          {\n            \"airline\": \"Air France\",\n            \"flightNumber\": \"AF123\",\n            \"origin\": \"BLR\",\n            \"destination\": \"NRT\",\n            \"departureDate\": \"2026-06-26\",\n            \"price\": 450.00,\n            \"currency\": \"USD\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"airline\": \"Lufthansa\",\n            \"flightNumber\": \"LH456\",\n            \"origin\": \"BLR\",\n            \"destination\": \"NRT\",\n            \"departureDate\": \"2026-06-26\",\n            \"price\": 520.00,\n            \"currency\": \"USD\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"error\": null,\n      \"latencyMs\": 450\n    },\n    {\n      \"stepId\": \"step-2\",\n      \"tool\": \"weather.forecast\",\n      \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"location\": \"Tokyo\",\n        \"date\": \"2026-06-26\",\n        \"temperatureCelsius\": 25.4,\n        \"condition\": \"Partly cloudy\",\n        \"humidityPercent\": 65,\n        \"windSpeedKph\": 15.3\n      },\n      \"error\": null,\n      \"latencyMs\": 320\n    }\n  ],\n  \"response\": null,\n  \"summary\": \"Found 2 flights from Bangalore to Tokyo on June 26. Weather in Tokyo: 25.4°C, partly cloudy.\",\n  \"clarificationRequired\": false,\n  \"clarificationMessage\": null\n}"
            }
          ],
            "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Response body exists\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.body();",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"X-Trace-Id response header exists\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"X-Trace-Id\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"X-Conversation-Id response header exists\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.header(\"X-Conversation-Id\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"X-Conversation-Id is a valid UUID\", () => {",
                  "    const val = pm.response.headers.get(\"X-Conversation-Id\");",
                  "    pm.expect(val).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
